  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg007.20",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg007.20",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Hiob 38, 7. Φωνὴ δὲ μεγάλη, ἡ μεγαλεῖα φθεγγομένη, ὡς τὸ ἀποστολικόν· »ἴδετε πηλίκοις ὑμῖν γράμμασι ἔγραψα« τοῖς τὰ τηλικαῦτα δηλονότι σημαίνουσιν.",
    "chunk_index": 57,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg007.21.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg007.21.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Hiob 38, 16. [Πάλιν ἐπὶ τὴν θάλασσαν τὸν λόγον μετήγαγεν. οὐχ ὡς πηγὴν τῆς θαλάσσης ἐχούσης, ἀλλ' ὡς μὴ ἐκλειπούσης, καθάπερ πηγὴν ἐχούσης.]",
    "chunk_index": 58,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg007.21.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg007.21.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "εἰς ἄβυσσον πολλοὶ καταβεβήκασιν· καταβεβήκασι δέ, ὥστε δέσμιοι εἶναι, οὐχ ὥστε περιπατεῖν ἐν αὐτῇ. Ἰησοῦς μόνος ἐν ἀβύσσῳ περιεπάτησεν ὡς ἐλεύθερος.",
    "chunk_index": 59,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg007.21.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg007.21.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ὅπου ἴχνη περιπατούντων οὐκ ἔνι [εἵλετο γὰρ θάνατον, οὐχ ὑπεύθυνος ὤν, ἵνα τοὺς ὑποκειμένους θανάτῶ λυτρώσηται].",
    "chunk_index": 60,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg007.21.s4",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg007.21.s4",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "καὶ λέγει τοῖς ἐν δεσμοῖς· ἐξέλθατε [καὶ τοῖς ἐν σκότει· ἀνακαλύφθητε«, ᾧ καὶ τὰ ἑξῆς συμφωνοῦσιν].",
    "chunk_index": 61,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg007.22.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg007.22.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Hiob 40, 3. [Ταῦτα ἅπερ ὑπέμεινας, μὴ οἴου ἀλόγως κεκρίσθαι μοι, μηδὲ ἀποποιοῦ μου τὸ κρίμα.",
    "chunk_index": 62,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg007.22.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg007.22.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τούτου τοῦ ῥητοῦ ὡς χρησίμου μνημονεύωμεν, ὅταν κρίνῃ ὁ θεὸς παθεῖν τι ἡμᾶς, τέκνον ἀποβαλεῖν, ἀρχὴν ἀπολέσι,",
    "chunk_index": 63,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg007.22.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg007.22.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "νοσῆσαι κατὰ τὸ σῶμα, ὅ τι δήποτε τούτων ὑποστῆναι· οὐδὲν τούτων οἷόν τε ἐστὶ παθεῖν ἡμᾶς, μὴ κρίνοντος τοῦ θεοῦ.",
    "chunk_index": 64,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg007.22.s4",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg007.22.s4",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἐπεὶ οὐν οὐδὲν τούτων γίνεται χωρὶς κρίματος θεοῦ, λέγεται πρὸς τὸν παθόντα· μὴ ἀποποιοῦ μου τὸ κρίμα, τουτέστι μὴ ἀπαρνοῦ ὅπερ ἔκρινα περὶ σοῦ.]",
    "chunk_index": 65,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg007.22.s5",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg007.22.s5",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "μὴ νομίσῃς, φησίν, ταῦτα ἅπερ ὑπέμεινας, ἀλόγως κεκρίσθαι μοι, ἀλλὰ προεισομένου μου τὸ συμφέρον σοι·",
    "chunk_index": 66,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg007.22.s6",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg007.22.s6",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "προσέθηκα γὰρ τοῖς πειρασμοῖς τὸν χρηματισμὸν οὐκ ἄλλου τινὸς ἕνεκεν, ἢ ἵνα δίκαιος ἀναφανῇς, ὅ ἐστι δειχθῇς ὅπερ ἠς.",
    "chunk_index": 67,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg007.23.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg007.23.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Hiob 40, 10. Ὡς ἀθλητής, μάνθανε τὰ περὶ τοῦ δράνοντος, τοῦ ἀνταγωνιστοῦ.",
    "chunk_index": 68,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg007.23.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg007.23.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "(»θηρία« αἱ ἀντικείμεναι δυνάμεις ἐστίν, περὶ ὡν ηὔξατο ὁ προφήτης λέγων· »μὴ παραδῷ ς τοῖς θηρίοις ψυχὴν ἐξομολογουμένην σοι«.",
    "chunk_index": 69,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg007.23.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg007.23.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "— »θηρία« εἰσὶν αἱ ἀντικείμεναι δυνάμεις, ὡν ειληφας, ὠ ἄνθρωπε, τὴν ἐξουσίαν ἐὰν θεῷ δουλεύσῃς, ἐπὶ ἀσπίδων καὶ βασιλίσκων ἐπιβαίνειν.]",
    "chunk_index": 70,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg007.24.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg007.24.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Hiob 40, 16 f. [Ταῦτα ὕλη καὶ τροφὴ πυρὸς τυγχάνει· αὐλίζεται δὲ μάλιστα παρὰ τοῖς ἄξίοις τοῦ πυρὸς, ὑπὸ τὰς ὑγρὰς καὶ ἀτόνους καὶ ἀκάρπους ψυχάς, αἳ πυρός εἰσιν ὑλαι.",
    "chunk_index": 71,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg007.24.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg007.24.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": ". . ἢ τοῦτο λέγει, ὅτι συνδιαιτῶνται αὐτῷ καὶ μεγάλοι τινὲς δαίμονες καὶ ὑποβεβηκότες τῇ κακίᾳ, ἢ ὅτι μικροὺς καὶ μεγάλους ἄνδρας ἐπέρχεται, πάντας ὁμοίως ὑποτρέχων.",
    "chunk_index": 72,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg007.24.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg007.24.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ῥάδαμνοι γὰρ αἱ παραφυάδες· λέγει οὖν ὡς ὑΠὸ σκιαῖς δένδρων. οὕτω παρὰ τούτοις ἐπαναπάυεται. »καὶ κλῶνες ἀγνοῦ«.",
    "chunk_index": 73,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg007.24.s4",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg007.24.s4",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἐπειδὴ πολλοὶ πολλάκις καὶ ἁγνείαν ἀσκήσαντες τῆς αὐτοῦ μερίδος γεγόνασιν, ὡς αἱ μωραὶ παρθένοι· εἰσὶ γὰρ καὶ παρ' αὐτῷ ἁγνεύοντες.]",
    "chunk_index": 74,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg007.25.s1",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg007.25.s1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Hiob 40, 21. 22. Ἵνα μηκέτι συρίζῃ ὁ δράκων. [τοῦτό φησι διὰ τὸ παρακληθῆναι ὑπὸ τῶν δαιμόνων μὴ βαλεῖν αὐτοὺς εἰς τὴν ἄβυσσον.",
    "chunk_index": 75,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg007.25.s2",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg007.25.s2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἢ τοῦτο λέγει διὰ τὸ εἰρηκέναι αὐτὸν τῷ κυρίῳ ταῦτά σοι πάντα σώσω« . . Ἣ ὅτι μὴ δύνασαι οὕτως ὑποτάξαι αὐτὸν ὡς αἱρεῖσθαι μηκέτι σοι πολεμεῖν.]",
    "chunk_index": 76,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg007.25.s3",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg007.25.s3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "— [τὸ »ψέλλιον« κόσμος ἐστὶ τῆς χειρός, τοῦτό ἐστι τὸ ἔργον ἀγαθόν.",
    "chunk_index": 77,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1#tlg2959.tlg007.25.s4",
    "work_id": "first1k/tlg2959/tlg007/opp-grc1",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg2959.tlg007.25.s4",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ὁ οὐν ἔχων τὸ τοιοῦτον ψέλλιον τρυπήσει τὸ χεῖλος τοῦ δράκοντος τοῦ ἐξ ἐναντίας τοῦ διαβόλου ἐντρεπομένου, μὴ ἔχοντός τι λαλῆσαι κατ' αὐτοῦ.]",
    "chunk_index": 78,
